{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "ppm_D_lev_nf_k2",
    "description": "No-flux near-surface boundary face for the conservative vertical PPM flux-divergence on the latlon3d hybrid vertical: the single k=2 cell slab, D f[i,j,2] = (F_{5/2} - F_{3/2})/dz[2] over all i (lon), all j (lat). F_{5/2}=ppm_lev_flux(f[i,j,1..4]; dz[1..4]; w_edge[3]) is fully interior; F_{3/2}=ppm_lev_flux(f[i,j,1], f[i,j,1], f[i,j,2], f[i,j,3]; dz[1], dz[1], dz[2], dz[3]; w_edge[2]) uses the zero-gradient sub-surface ghost (cell 0 = cell 1) and is byte-identical to the k=1 face's F_{3/2}, so the divergence telescopes and mass is conserved to the bit. One of four factored no-flux boundary faces consumed by rules/ppm_D_lev_noflux_bc; a full (NLON x NLAT x 1) slab AGGREGATE in its own single-purpose stencil so the rule body stays a thin makearray of apply calls. Reads free names dz (widths) and w_edge (interface velocity).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:latlon3d",
      "op:D",
      "order:4",
      "stencil_width:4"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Colella, P., & Woodward, P. R. (1984). The Piecewise Parabolic Method (PPM) for gas-dynamical simulations. Journal of Computational Physics, 54(1), 174-201.",
        "doi": "10.1016/0021-9991(84)90143-8"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    { "ref": "../grid.esm" },
    { "ref": "./ppm_lev_flux.esm" }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "ppm_D_lev_nf_k2": {
      "params": ["f"],
      "body": {
        "op": "aggregate",
        "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
        "args": ["f"],
        "ranges": {
          "i": { "from": "lon" },
          "j": { "from": "lat" },
          "k": [2, 2]
        },
        "expr": {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
            {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "ppm_lev_flux",
                  "bindings": {
                    "am": { "op": "index", "args": ["f", "i", "j", 1] },
                    "a0": { "op": "index", "args": ["f", "i", "j", 2] },
                    "ap": { "op": "index", "args": ["f", "i", "j", 3] },
                    "app": { "op": "index", "args": ["f", "i", "j", 4] },
                    "dm": { "op": "index", "args": ["dz", 1] },
                    "d0": { "op": "index", "args": ["dz", 2] },
                    "dp": { "op": "index", "args": ["dz", 3] },
                    "dpp": { "op": "index", "args": ["dz", 4] },
                    "w": { "op": "index", "args": ["w_edge", 3] }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "ppm_lev_flux",
                  "bindings": {
                    "am": { "op": "index", "args": ["f", "i", "j", 1] },
                    "a0": { "op": "index", "args": ["f", "i", "j", 1] },
                    "ap": { "op": "index", "args": ["f", "i", "j", 2] },
                    "app": { "op": "index", "args": ["f", "i", "j", 3] },
                    "dm": { "op": "index", "args": ["dz", 1] },
                    "d0": { "op": "index", "args": ["dz", 1] },
                    "dp": { "op": "index", "args": ["dz", 2] },
                    "dpp": { "op": "index", "args": ["dz", 3] },
                    "w": { "op": "index", "args": ["w_edge", 2] }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            { "op": "index", "args": ["dz", 2] }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
